 ### [Perceptual Distillation Module](13792-perceptual-distillation-module.md)
-Addresses 3D geometric inconsistency inherent in independently deblurred multi-view images by using pre-deblurred images as a perceptual prior to transfer texture information to the implicit clean radiance fields. It sets itself apart by enforcing feature-level consistency between rendered patches and pre-deblurred patches.
